        "description": "Source-owned Psi-Weapon starts at 1D6 Mega-Damage, adding 1D6 at levels 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15. From level 3, a second Psi-Weapon may be created, one in each hand.  Standard blue-white sword appears instantly without an action or duration limit. Non-sword forms cost one creation action; unusual colors add another. Reshaping costs two actions. Thrown forms, moving parts and projectiles are unavailable. Size and blunt or bladed shape do not change damage. Metallic, black and earth colors are unavailable. Pure white costs five creation actions, one upkeep action each round and imposes -10% to skills while present. These are descriptive choices, not encounter automation.",
